### List users
GET http://localhost:8080/api/social/users

### Create user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/social/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "dave",
  "email": "dave@example.com",
  "displayName": "Dave",
  "bio": "Tester"
}

### Follow
POST http://localhost:8080/api/social/follows
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "followerId": 2,
  "followeeId": 1
}

### Unfollow
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/social/follows
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "followerId": 2,
  "followeeId": 1
}

### Create post
POST http://localhost:8080/api/social/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "authorId": 1,
  "content": "New post from Alice",
  "visibility": "PUBLIC"
}

### Like a post
POST http://localhost:8080/api/social/posts/1/likes?userId=2

### Unlike a post
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/social/posts/1/likes?userId=2

### Comment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/social/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "postId": 1,
  "authorId": 2,
  "content": "Nice post!"
}

### Feed
GET http://localhost:8080/api/social/feed?userId=2
